-- help-grid.txt --
tmux grid for <repo>, one agent per pane in its own worktree; re-running adds panes

Usage:
  sprawl grid <repo> [<account>:]<name>... [flags]
  sprawl grid [command]

Examples:
  sprawl grid ~/repo feat-a personal:fix-b          per-agent account (default: main or -a)
  sprawl grid ~/repo feat-a claude/personal:fix-b   account as provider/name
  sprawl grid ~/repo feat-1 feat-2 --spread         round-robin over logged-in accounts
  sprawl grid ls | attach [repo] | stop [repo]

Available Commands:
  attach      Attach to the grid of a repository (default: this one)
  ls          List running grids
  stop        Stop the grid of a repository and every agent in it (worktrees are kept)

Flags:
  -h, --help     help for grid
      --spread   spread unprefixed names over logged-in accounts

